{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"344e02890cfee311b851898c65f17af9fc72286e27cc6227432625fa9b814f42","ja":"悩みの迷路","zh":"烦恼的迷宫","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b8b42900b6283a810b1747d1e3e67e2ef606c3fc39af4470aea022e530f1974a","ja":"まだ決まってないって……準備のこととか考えたら、\nもう、かなりヤバイ時期なんじゃない？","zh":"还没定下来吗……考虑到筹备之类的事，\n现在已经到相当不妙的时期了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e1f5bbaa37d11beb6706bc5d8352a1420e227d2bfc1bf13e24194e82baf24383","ja":"はい……でも、ファンの人に喜んでもらうには\nどんな企画にすればいいか迷ってしまって……。","zh":"是的……可是，为了能让粉丝们高兴，\n我有点拿不准该做成什么样的企划才好……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"db320853457f7698c0b91c46d495f1a5db1a00090412720d25013630f627a141","ja":"お花見公演は、自分だけ楽しんでしまいましたし……\nだからその分、今度はファンのためにって思うんです。","zh":"赏花公演的时候，只有我自己乐在其中了……\n所以我觉得，这次一定要为了粉丝们而加倍努力。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8f1b1ab77100f331346a69c3a9086f507c9f6ab0bca76c3e6ed490f2651972fc","ja":"それで、そんなに悩んでるんだ？\nボクはあっさり決めちゃったからなぁ……。","zh":"所以你才那么苦恼吗？\n我倒是很爽快就决定好了呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2fec95f85ff1047482cce635b4da26e43a7f2ab5f3578c4b7bf7ff46ed10b36d","ja":"ファンのみんなと楽しく体動かせたらな～って\n思って、ソフトバレーにしてみたんだけど。","zh":"想着要是能和各位粉丝一起开开心心地运动一下就好了～\n所以试着选了气排球。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ffd33db3874d836c8e33a27b638afa39e881b2e209b8d3df7197c2bbe1a2e89a","ja":"スポーツが得意な真さんらしくて、ファンの人も\n一緒に楽しめるイベントですね……。","zh":"真擅长运动的风格展现得淋漓尽致，\n是一个能让粉丝也一起乐在其中的活动呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b8068ddf597b2545f9d349ec05a4058404f385f4eb3b2ec42aeb827ec183eb01","ja":"へへっ、ありがと、静香。\n雪歩は、どんな内容にしたの？","zh":"嘿嘿，谢谢你，静香。\n雪步写了什么内容呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8dfaf35cb94de38ae9035f46855c73b08f14b7a52c41e1acdb8459f467072053","ja":"私は利きワイン……みたいな感じで、\n利き日本茶ゲームをするだけなんだけど……。","zh":"我只是想玩品日本茶游戏……\n类似品红酒那样就是了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8f14f802bac8e3f9e0e0a12b31bdb28393a90200e0d73eb75c06b07b9566604d","ja":"雪歩さんの趣味を活かしていて、\nクイズ形式でみんなで楽しめる企画ですね……。","zh":"发挥了雪步的爱好，\n而且是问答形式，能让大家一起乐在其中的企划呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"95e1e9fc59538cff105665c1a1babbd16bc14fac30c728a8eb4be903c7801b81","ja":"ふたりともしっかり考えてるのに……。\n私はどうしたらいいんだろう……。","zh":"两个人明明都考虑得很周全……\n我该怎么办才好呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1165.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0029e024f6598d552e1e27fcab551d2ffcba6b487c7167678512047245498551","ja":"し、静香……？　大丈夫……？","zh":"静、静香……？没事吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
